# UI Rules

Use XML layouts only.

Use View Binding.

Follow Material Design.

## Layout

Prefer

- ConstraintLayout
- RecyclerView
- Material Components

Avoid

- Deep nested layouts
- Unnecessary ViewGroups

## Theme

Support

- Light Theme
- Dark Theme
- System Theme

Theme must

- Follow system by default.
- Allow manual switching.
- Persist user selection.

## Accessibility

Always

- Use contentDescription.
- Support dynamic font scaling.
- Use meaningful labels.
- Respect touch target sizes.

## UI

Keep UI logic inside ViewModel.

Fragments should only render state.